asure how transfer changes. The results show an average improvement of 0.035 after projection, with low-resource languages gaining the most (0.052), mid-resource gaining substantially (0.041), and high-resource gaining least (0.018) since they already transfer well—suggesting the effect is capability-dominated rather than driven by other factors. The pattern across model depths is clear—deeper layers capture increasingly stronger capability signals once difficulty is removed. The key insight is that difficulty and capability are entangled in the activation space, but their roles differ by language resource level: for high-resource languages, removing difficulty noise reveals the true capability signal and improves transfer by 4.2%, while for low-resource languages, difficulty itself carries most of the correctness information, so removing it actually hurts performance. Generating markdown table... 现在我在查看跨语言正交性分析的具体指标——20种语言和2种架构的余弦相似度分布，从西班牙语的最低值0.012到阿姆哈拉语的最高值0.058，平均值0.032。资源层级间存在显著差异，高资源语言的正交性更强（0.028），而低资源语言的正交性较弱（0.039），这与排列检验的p值<0.001一致，表明这种模式远非随机。\n\n架构间的差异较小，Qwen和Llama的平均值分别为0.029和0.035，说明正交性是模型设计的基本特性而非架构特异性的。\n\n资源层级与余弦相似度的关联在统计上处于边界（p=0.052），提示了可能的趋势但证据还不够确定。现在我在查看各语言间的具体数值对比，从英文的0.028到斯瓦希里语的0.045，以及阿姆哈拉语更高的0.047。\n\n这些数据点都集中在很小的范围内，验证了正交性在跨语言中普遍成立，这强化了输出校准方法存在结构性限制的结论，进一步支持采用基于探针的方法。接下来我在比较逻辑回归和两层多层感知机在跨语言迁移中的表现。 The MLP's nonlinear capacity gives it a slight edge on English, but it comes at the cost of learning language-specific patterns that don't transfer well—showing 18.7% degradation versus the linear model's 13.7%. This overfitting is especially pronounced in low-resource languages where the linear probe maintains better generalization, reinforcing that a linear approach is the safer default choice. 线性探针在跨语言迁移上表现更好，这验证了我的假设——MLP 的额外容量捕捉的是语言特定特征而不是语言无关的正确性方向。所以在后续分析中继续使用线性探针是正确的选择。现在我需要用 Belebele 和 MMLU-ProX 这两个基准来验证模型的泛化能力。\n\nBelebele 是阅读理解任务，MMLU-ProX 是翻译后的 MMLU，我看到两个基准上的零样本排名相关性都很高（0.89 和 0.93），说明探针的排名一致性很强，虽然 Belebele 的 AUROC 略低于 GlobalMMLU，这是因